{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Embark on an Inspiring Eco-Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like exploring wild places, admiring nature, and making the world cleaner? Then this game is for you! Combine leisurely walks through breathtaking landscapes with environmental care: pick up trash, help animals, and discover hidden natural wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/d4fa183d66db7e626be8993730dbf810.poster.avif?t=1754657236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/d4fa183d66db7e626be8993730dbf810.webm?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/d4fa183d66db7e626be8993730dbf810.mp4?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore, Clean, Protect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into vast, diverse parks, forests, and beaches that change with the seasons. Your mission isn\u2019t just to enjoy the views\u2014but to restore balance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect trash (from small litter to large debris) and sort it for recycling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue animals and people\u2014search for lost pets and stranded hikers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Photograph wildlife and curate a unique scrapbook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete missions, earn rewards, and upgrade your tools.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/720deaa5bf4f74d5ebf3ccdf08f55022.poster.avif?t=1754657236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/720deaa5bf4f74d5ebf3ccdf08f55022.webm?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/720deaa5bf4f74d5ebf3ccdf08f55022.mp4?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mindful Gameplay with Purpose</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic physics and procedurally generated tasks\u2014every trip into nature is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your eco-activism: buy gear, upgrade and customize your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive atmosphere: listen to tranquil forest sounds, observe plants and wildlife, and snap photos for your album.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/5dd9507acb14b200612ab7fe35a35212.poster.avif?t=1754657236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/5dd9507acb14b200612ab7fe35a35212.webm?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/5dd9507acb14b200612ab7fe35a35212.mp4?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relax and Make a Difference</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you crave a deeper connection with nature or dream of becoming an eco-volunteer, this game offers peace, the joy of doing good, and a chance to heal a virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nature awaits your help!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919340?t=1754657236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/f7bbb52e19931ef3afdaa86975681424892a28