stranded hikers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Photograph wildlife and curate a unique scrapbook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete missions, earn rewards, and upgrade your tools.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/720deaa5bf4f74d5ebf3ccdf08f55022.poster.avif?t=1754657236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/720deaa5bf4f74d5ebf3ccdf08f55022.webm?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/720deaa5bf4f74d5ebf3ccdf08f55022.mp4?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mindful Gameplay with Purpose</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic physics and procedurally generated tasks\u2014every trip into nature is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your eco-activism: buy gear, upgrade and customize your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive atmosphere: listen to tranquil forest sounds, observe plants and wildlife, and snap photos for your album.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/5dd9507acb14b200612ab7fe35a35212.poster.avif?t=1754657236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/5dd9507acb14b200612ab7fe35a35212.webm?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/5dd9507acb14b200612ab7fe35a35212.mp4?t=1754657236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relax and Make a 